title: Machine Account Creation by Standard User
id: 9897db0b-5064-41ca-9251-cf0488c3c3ec
status: experimental
description: Detects a standard (non-admin) user creating computer accounts (event 4741), abusing the default MachineAccountQuota, a primitive used in noPac, RBCD, and sAMAccountName-spoofing attack chains.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1136/
logsource:
  product: windows
  service: security
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 4741
  filter:
    SubjectUserName|endswith: '$'
  condition: selection and not filter
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SubjectUserName
  - TargetUserName
falsepositives:
  - IT staff joining machines to the domain
level: high
tags:
  - attack.persistence
  - attack.t1136
